{#-
ADR-121 Ebene-0 "Warum-Box".

Whitespace (2026-07-28): the note blocks use `{% if %}`, NOT `{%- if %}`. The
Jinja env runs with trim_blocks=True, which already eats the newline AFTER the
tag; a left-strip as well ate the newline BEFORE it, and the note rendered glued
to the previous sentence ("...derived from these 3 services.> Note: ..."). The
old test only asserted substring presence, so it never saw it.

Numerus: German and English both need agreement here. A count of 1 read as
"1 weitere erkannte Dienste ... sind", which is simply wrong German in a
customer document.
-#}
